  "description": "Issue J audio circuit from R.G. Keen / General Guitar Gadgets. Each EH1048 phase stage is represented by a current-controlled CA3080 OTA and Darlington buffer. A compensated analog relaxation oscillator supplies the shared bias in place of the original CA3094 oscillator. Color links the feedback path and sweep range.",
